STRINGTABLE
BEGIN
    PRMT_SV_CONTENTS_LIST   "Specifies the class of graphics data affected by this theme. Can be a symbol or TAG Prefix (preceeded by a -)"
    PRMT_SV_ITEM_TYPE       "Specifies the type of graphics elements (points, polylines, areas) affected by this theme."
    PRMT_SV_DATABASE_LIST   "Specifies the attribute database used by this theme"
    PRMT_SV_TABLE_NAMES     "Specifies which table in the database is to be used, if the specified database contains multiple tables"
    PRMT_SV_FIELDFUNCTION   "Specifies what information is retrieved about the specified field (-more-)"
    MORE_SV_FIELDFUNCTION   "Can be the field value, number or occurences or summary statistics (i.e. min, max, average)"
    MORE_SV_CONTENTS_LIST   "More data about contents"
