    MORE_SV_DISPLAY_PCT     "The values are based on the current display, regardless of the Recompute setting."
    PRMT_IDC_SAVE_THEME     "Save the theme into an external file. (-more-)"
    MORE_IDC_SAVE_THEME     "The currently loaded theme for each legend viewport is also saved when you save a configuration."
    PRMT_IDC_LOAD_THEME     "Recalls a theme from an external file and makes it the current theme for this viewport. (-more-)"
    MORE_IDC_LOAD_THEME     "The current theme is replace by the new theme so be sure to save any changes you wish to keep before recalling a theme."
    MORE_SV_NUM_CLASSES     "Fewer classes may be selected by the system if you use Even Number Per Class and the data can not be grouped into the specified number or classes."
    PRMT_SV_COLOR_SCHEME    "Selects a set of colors (if areas are being displayed), line descriptions (if lines are being displayed) or symbols (if points are being displayed) (-more-)"
    MORE_SV_COLOR_SCHEME    "Selecting a symbol set will replace any user defined colors. Conversely if the GF_SET_CLASS_COLOR command is used it overrides the symbol set color for the class."
